twodrive (0.2.16-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Preserve file identity when a repeated rename follows a cloud-completed move.
  * Validate replacement preconditions within the SQLite write transaction and
    roll back source deletion when the target cannot be updated.
  * Add cached-inode, open-handle and actual FUSE regression coverage.
  * Keep the stable README focused on shipped GNOME/Linux functionality.
  * Retain standard offline dpkg-buildpackage/debhelper source and binary builds.

